<title>USA: U.S. BOXED BEEF CUT-OUT AT 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. BOXED BEEF CUT-OUT AT 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef sharply lower on fairly good demand and heavy offerings.  Select and Choice chuck, round and loin cuts lower. Select rib cuts lower, while Choice rib cuts weak. Beef trimmings lower on moderate demand and moderate to heavy offerings. - USDA</p>
<p>------</p>
<p>350 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
<p> 81 50s Lds  550/700     700/850     550/700     700/850</p>
<p>69 Grd Lds ---------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Values =     106.40	105.92	 98.43	 97.73</p>
<p>Changes	  -1.33	 -1.49	 -1.52	 -1.73</p>
<p>Rib	  170.31	169.52	151.33	149.79</p>
<p>Chuck	 73.76	 72.37	 72.26	 70.02</p>
<p>Round	 92.64	 92.64	 88.76	 88.76</p>
<p>Loin	 166.32	166.43	144.04	144.71</p>
<p>Brisket     60.46	 60.46	 62.35	 62.35</p>
<p>Shrt Plate  65.83	 65.75	 66.07	 65.90</p>
<p>Flank	 57.96	 57.96	 58.92	 58.92</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
